0003 — classlink.rs build_class: final properties and trait property binding.

* do_inherit_property: redeclaring a final parent property (static or not)
  fails with "Cannot override final property %s::$%s"; overriding a final
  parent hook with "Cannot override final property hook %s::$%s::get()"
  (inherit_property_hook).
* zend_do_traits_property_binding: trait properties are bound after the
  class's own properties (php-src order: var_dump shows own properties
  first) and before inheritance, so they are checked only against own and
  earlier-trait properties: hooked collisions give "%s and %s define the
  same hooked property ($%s) in the composition of %s. Conflict resolution
  between hooked properties is currently not supported. Class was composed",
  other collisions must match in visibility/static/readonly, type and
  (identical) default value or fail with "%s and %s define the same
  property ($%s) in the composition of %s. However, the definition differs
  and is considered incompatible. Class was composed"; compatible ones are
  dropped. A readonly class using a trait with a non-readonly property
  fails with "Readonly class %s cannot use trait with a non-readonly
  property %s::$%s". Defaults that still need evaluation (ConstExpr::Code)
  are assumed compatible since build_class has no VM.

Fixes: Zend/tests/property_hooks/final, final_prop, final_prop_2,
final_prop_promoted_{1,2,3,4}, traits_conflict; Zend/tests/readonly_props/
readonly_trait_mismatch, readonly_with_default_trait_mismatch;
Zend/tests/readonly_classes/gh9285_error; Zend/tests/traits/bug60369,
bug74269, bugs/overridding-conflicting-property-initializer.

